<title>USA: Niagara Mohawk seeks delay on setting rates.</title>
<headline>Niagara Mohawk seeks delay on setting rates.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Niagara Mohawk Power Corp said Thursday that it is requesting that its 1997 rate request proceeding with the Public Service Commission be delayed 14 days while it focuses on resolving issues related to its recently announced agreement in principle to terminate or restructure its independent power contracts.</p>
<p>The company said eight previous extension have been granted, and has told athe PSC that it hopes the 1997 rate proceeding can be submitted April 4.</p>
</text>
